"description": "Dermapharm Holding SE engages in the development, manufacture, and marketing of patent-free pharmaceutical products. It operates through the Branded Pharmaceuticals and Other Healthcare Products, Parallel Import Business, and Herbal Extracts divisions. Its product covers prescription pharmaceuticals (Rx), over-the-counter (OTC) products, medical devices, food supplements, and cosmetics. The company was founded in 1991 and is headquartered in Grunwald, Germany.",
